From: scalpel4k <scalpel4k@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: declare QCC2072 firmware

ath12k supports QCC2072 (hw1.0) but only lists QCN9274 and WCN7850 in
MODULE_FIRMWARE. Image builders (dracut, image-janitor fw-cleanup in the
openSUSE Agama installer) rely on it and drop ath12k/QCC2072/, so MHI fails
to load the firmware.

Upstream candidate.
---
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
@@ -1863,3 +1863,4 @@
 /* firmware files */
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(ATH12K_FW_DIR "/QCN9274/hw2.0/*");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE(ATH12K_FW_DIR "/WCN7850/hw2.0/*");
+MODULE_FIRMWARE(ATH12K_FW_DIR "/QCC2072/hw1.0/*");
